-------------------------------------------------------
Resume: Java, Python, JavaScript, C++, REST APIs, Git, Agile, SQL
Matched: Java, Python, JavaScript, C++, Git, Agile, SQL
Skill Match: 70%
Final Score: 56% (70×0.8 + 55×0.2)
Status: ✓ CORRECT - Should be high

