----------------------------------------------
Resume: JS and Node, React front-end, TypeScript, REST APIs
Matched: JavaScript, React, Node.js, TypeScript, REST APIs
Skill Match: 50%
Final Score: 50% (50×0.8 + 50×0.2)
Status: ✓ CORRECT - Partial matches recognized

TEST 5: Empty Resume
-------------------
Resume: (empty)
Score: 0
Status: ✓ CORRECT - Zero for empty


5. IMPLEMENTATION DETAILS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

File: scoring_engine.py

Classes:
- ResumeScoringEngine: Main scoring engine class

Methods:
- preprocess_text(): Clean and filter resume text
- normalize_word(): Apply synonym expansion
- check_partial_match(): Support abbreviations
- analyze_resume(): Main analysis function
- _set_edge_case(): Handle edge cases
- _calculate_strict_score(): Low match scoring
- _calculate_final_score(): Normal scoring formula

Functions:
- analyze_resume(): Public API function
- JOB_SKILLS: Dictionary of all category skills
- SYNONYMS: Abbreviation mappings
- GENERIC_WORDS: Words to ignore


