8. KEY GUARDS AGAINST FALSE POSITIVES
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

1. Generic word filter prevents common resume words from matching
2. Category-specific skills only - no cross-category matches
3. <20% match threshold forces low score
4. Semantic reset when skill_match = 0
5. Edge cases handled explicitly (empty, no match, wrong category)


